WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.560 --> 01:40.770
You brothers

01:40.790 --> 01:42.130
will have plenty of time

01:42.150 --> 01:43.410
to mend the bonds later.

01:43.430 --> 01:44.290
Right now, we must

01:44.310 --> 01:47.100
make good use of this victory.

01:47.120 --> 01:48.260
Who

01:48.590 --> 01:51.180
stopped you from finding your Senior?

01:51.430 --> 01:53.900
Once you become King of East Sea,

01:53.920 --> 01:54.930
and with the Celestial Court's help,

01:54.950 --> 01:57.100
finding someone will be effortless.

01:57.790 --> 02:01.740
And who washed away
all your spiritual power,

02:02.120 --> 02:04.130
and put you through such suffering?

02:04.920 --> 02:06.900
This is a tough spot.

02:07.920 --> 02:08.690
No worries.

02:09.120 --> 02:10.730
Switching to Deep Clean mode.

02:15.520 --> 02:16.290
Here you go.

02:27.360 --> 02:28.340
How is that possible?

02:33.910 --> 02:34.780
How

02:36.800 --> 02:37.980
could it be him?

02:38.710 --> 02:39.690
Your Highness.

02:40.590 --> 02:41.660
Your sense of smell

02:42.520 --> 02:44.500
should be back by now.

02:44.750 --> 02:46.540
Why not try

02:47.800 --> 02:49.410
sniffing out

02:50.710 --> 02:52.690
who he really is?

02:56.190 --> 02:57.610
Changshou.

02:57.630 --> 02:58.340
He's breathing.

02:58.800 --> 02:59.570
Your Highness.

02:59.630 --> 03:00.540
I'm Li Changshou.

03:01.400 --> 03:02.500
Changshou.

03:02.710 --> 03:03.690
I am Li Changshou.

03:04.430 --> 03:05.610
Get closer to me.

03:12.520 --> 03:14.100
You're Changgeng.

03:17.430 --> 03:17.850
He...

03:18.190 --> 03:19.610
He just woke up. How's he out again?

03:24.630 --> 03:25.410
Yunxiao?

03:27.240 --> 03:27.890
Yunxiao.

03:28.360 --> 03:29.380
How is it?

03:34.800 --> 03:35.890
Did you see Jin Chan?

03:38.560 --> 03:39.450
Yunxiao?

03:55.430 --> 03:56.570
She's not Yunxiao.

03:56.590 --> 03:58.340
She was my Master a thousand years ago.

03:58.360 --> 04:00.220
The Demon Emperor, Taiyi.

04:03.280 --> 04:05.290
Ao Guang greets Master.

04:05.520 --> 04:06.890
You shameless traitor.

04:07.360 --> 04:08.610
You dare to show your face again?

04:10.240 --> 04:11.980
The terror from 1,000 years ago,

04:12.960 --> 04:14.780
do you still remember?

04:21.720 --> 04:23.540
Moon Elder, go get the painting.

04:25.950 --> 04:27.100
You are right.

04:27.190 --> 04:29.700
I betrayed you all those years ago.

04:29.830 --> 04:31.540
My crimes deserve a thousand deaths.

04:32.000 --> 04:33.020
But today,

04:33.120 --> 04:34.540
I am willing to redeem myself.

04:34.560 --> 04:35.540
I will follow you, Master.

04:35.560 --> 04:38.290
Even if it costs my life.

04:47.360 --> 04:48.580
Your Majesty.

04:48.600 --> 04:49.290
Your Majesty.

04:49.800 --> 04:50.580
Your Majesty.

04:51.120 --> 04:52.170
A fake.

04:54.120 --> 04:54.980
These days,

04:55.120 --> 04:56.540
who doesn't keep a guard up?

05:45.120 --> 05:45.900
Scatter.

06:18.630 --> 06:19.490
What a fine sword.

06:20.510 --> 06:21.930
It has been a thousand years.

06:23.420 --> 06:26.340
[Episode 27]

06:37.600 --> 06:38.250
Your Highness.

06:39.310 --> 06:40.730
You've already lost.

06:41.190 --> 06:42.580
Why bother resisting?

06:43.510 --> 06:44.290
Both of you

06:45.510 --> 06:47.980
are going to die.

06:51.750 --> 06:52.540
Your Highness.

06:54.720 --> 06:56.220
At last, before I die,

06:57.510 --> 06:59.290
I see you as you once were.

07:00.160 --> 07:01.290
Don't talk nonsense.

07:02.510 --> 07:03.540
You won't die.

07:04.190 --> 07:05.170
I'll protect you.

07:08.720 --> 07:09.490
Your Highness.

07:16.630 --> 07:18.610
Seeing you return like this,

07:20.720 --> 07:22.370
I can die with no regrets.

07:28.000 --> 07:28.780
Si'er,

07:30.920 --> 07:32.900
that's why you need to stay alive.

07:33.160 --> 07:34.220
We still have

07:34.720 --> 07:35.980
so much time ahead of us.

07:37.950 --> 07:39.980
I have to make it up to you, slowly.

07:44.920 --> 07:46.580
Done with your last words?

07:47.510 --> 07:49.340
Then I'm about to strike.

07:50.720 --> 07:51.490
Live on.

07:54.920 --> 07:55.780
Your Highness.

07:56.780 --> 08:03.890
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

08:04.390 --> 08:11.890
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

08:12.120 --> 08:12.810
Your Highness.

08:13.390 --> 08:14.050
You...

08:18.800 --> 08:19.730
Dragon Transformation?

08:20.360 --> 08:21.170
Your Highness.

08:22.000 --> 08:23.610
You are gravely wounded.

08:25.000 --> 08:26.370
If you force the transformation,

08:26.630 --> 08:28.340
aren't you afraid your spiritual power

08:28.560 --> 08:29.980
will collapse and kill you?

08:31.310 --> 08:32.100
No.

08:33.150 --> 08:34.610
You can't control me now.

08:35.600 --> 08:36.610
Are you afraid?

08:38.720 --> 08:39.700
I, Ao Jia,

08:40.390 --> 08:42.180
was bound by your Demonic Arts

08:44.150 --> 08:45.700
and committed countless sins.

08:46.510 --> 08:47.300
Consider this

08:48.840 --> 08:50.980
my way of making amends.

08:54.790 --> 08:55.580
Your Highness,

08:56.360 --> 08:57.580
are you going

08:58.360 --> 08:59.890
to take us both down?

09:00.120 --> 09:02.180
To take the true culprit with me

09:03.630 --> 09:04.420
is worth it.

09:05.960 --> 09:06.770
Your Highness.

09:08.030 --> 09:09.700
Si'er, run!

09:09.720 --> 09:10.460
Your Highness.

09:11.720 --> 09:13.010
I won't leave you.

09:13.030 --> 09:13.890
Stay back.

09:14.000 --> 09:15.220
Go find Ao Yi immediately.

09:15.360 --> 09:16.490
He must still be alive.

09:16.600 --> 09:17.700
Tell him,

09:19.840 --> 09:21.100
his brother has failed.

09:22.790 --> 09:24.010
The East Sea Dragon Clan

09:25.030 --> 09:26.730
now rests on his shoulders.

09:29.120 --> 09:29.940
Go!

09:31.390 --> 09:31.940
No.

09:32.390 --> 09:33.180
Go!

09:37.360 --> 09:38.180
Now!

09:40.380 --> 09:47.240
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

09:47.240 --> 09:47.980
Your Highness.

09:48.910 --> 09:50.130
Such noble resolve.

09:55.270 --> 10:02.120
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

10:02.400 --> 10:09.680
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

10:09.920 --> 10:16.680
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

10:16.910 --> 10:18.530
Ao Jia!

10:18.530 --> 10:24.760
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

10:24.760 --> 10:31.610
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

10:35.910 --> 10:37.980
Pity, such a pity.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.300
Such a brave young man.

10:41.240 --> 10:43.700
Yet he couldn't escape destiny.

10:55.910 --> 10:57.610
Truly a fine vessel.

10:58.960 --> 11:01.100
Saves me quite some effort.

11:08.790 --> 11:10.370
Leave Yunxiao's body.

11:22.120 --> 11:23.820
Most people tremble

11:24.000 --> 11:25.490
at the sight of me.

11:25.750 --> 11:27.010
Yet you dare resist?

11:27.030 --> 11:28.940
Get out now.

11:30.510 --> 11:32.300
The Pregenesis Sword is in my hand.

11:32.910 --> 11:34.340
Keeping you is now pointless.

11:39.790 --> 11:41.610
To die at my hand

11:41.750 --> 11:43.130
is your honor.

11:51.720 --> 11:53.300
You dare defy me?

11:59.510 --> 12:01.130
Little brat, run.

12:01.840 --> 12:02.700
Yunxiao.

12:14.320 --> 12:15.530
For him,

12:16.120 --> 12:17.940
you'd resist so stubbornly.

12:20.790 --> 12:22.100
How amusing.

12:35.910 --> 12:36.730
Senior...

12:37.360 --> 12:38.490
Senior...

12:51.240 --> 12:52.010
It's you.

12:52.600 --> 12:54.130
Why are you in my wedding dress?

12:59.000 --> 13:00.610
You're the Westdawn assassin?

13:01.200 --> 13:01.980
No.

13:02.360 --> 13:03.300
Let go.

13:03.960 --> 13:04.770
Where's Ao Yi?

13:06.910 --> 13:08.100
I'm asking you, where's Ao Yi?

13:08.240 --> 13:09.300
None of your concern.

13:09.550 --> 13:10.770
Who are you?

13:11.550 --> 13:12.820
Why come to the East Sea?

13:13.120 --> 13:14.220
I came for revenge.

13:15.150 --> 13:16.530
You killed Ao Yi?

13:18.630 --> 13:19.490
Didn't you?

13:45.790 --> 13:46.890
Ao Yi can still be saved.

13:58.720 --> 14:00.300
Your Majesty.

14:00.720 --> 14:02.530
Please be careful, Your Majesty.

14:06.440 --> 14:07.340
Turtle.

14:09.550 --> 14:10.730
I am truly useless.

14:12.240 --> 14:13.180
It seems

14:14.630 --> 14:16.300
I'm so old.

14:17.720 --> 14:20.130
No. Your Majesty is ever mighty,

14:20.240 --> 14:21.130
and full of vigor.

14:21.150 --> 14:21.890
Enough.

14:22.440 --> 14:23.420
At a time like this,

14:23.600 --> 14:25.610
stop flattering me.

14:26.550 --> 14:27.890
I know it well.

14:28.600 --> 14:31.610
I've ruled the East Sea
for a thousand years.

14:31.630 --> 14:35.220
I thought I could outplay everyone

14:35.360 --> 14:36.890
and always come out on top.

14:39.960 --> 14:41.010
But the truth is,

14:41.600 --> 14:42.700
I lost this game

14:43.030 --> 14:45.300
long ago.

14:46.910 --> 14:50.180
I was just too arrogant to see it,

14:50.720 --> 14:53.100
so sure I had already won.

14:57.910 --> 14:58.460
Your Majesty.

14:59.030 --> 15:01.010
I made your decoction.

15:01.200 --> 15:02.300
It's almost cold.

15:02.390 --> 15:03.220
Take it while it's warm.

15:08.910 --> 15:10.890
What happened
to you and Yunxiao out there?

15:10.910 --> 15:11.610
How dare you?

15:11.870 --> 15:12.610
Turtle.

15:14.000 --> 15:14.770
What?

15:16.200 --> 15:18.180
The real Pregenesis Sword fragment

15:18.510 --> 15:20.730
was stolen by that Demon Emperor?

15:20.960 --> 15:22.300
I'm asking you.

15:22.720 --> 15:24.940
Wasn't that Demon Emperor
sealed beneath the Eye of the Sea?

15:25.200 --> 15:25.940
He was.

15:25.960 --> 15:27.890
Then why is he possessing Yunxiao?

15:28.720 --> 15:30.980
How much do you know
of the Demon Emperor?

15:31.120 --> 15:33.010
You think that was the Demon Emperor

15:33.030 --> 15:34.890
at full strength?

15:34.910 --> 15:36.100
You're wrong.

15:36.910 --> 15:38.580
That was only a thousandth

15:38.600 --> 15:41.370
of the power he had
a thousand years ago.

15:51.200 --> 15:52.130
A thousand years ago,

15:52.720 --> 15:54.580
this place

15:54.840 --> 15:57.100
was the Demon Emperor's palace.

15:57.150 --> 15:59.980
He united all the demons under his rule,

16:00.240 --> 16:03.580
leaving a trail of blood and death

16:03.910 --> 16:06.300
across the Three Realms.

16:07.000 --> 16:09.770
The Demon Emperor was mighty,

16:10.360 --> 16:12.060
and ruthless beyond measure.

16:12.510 --> 16:15.730
He used the Pregenesis Sword

16:15.960 --> 16:18.180
to counter human magic.

16:18.320 --> 16:20.890
Even the Three Sects joined forces,

16:21.240 --> 16:23.700
yet still could not defeat him.

16:24.600 --> 16:25.580
Back then,

16:26.510 --> 16:27.900
[Demon Emperor Taiyi,]
I was

16:27.900 --> 16:29.520
[Lord of Ancient Demon Court]
his chief general.

16:30.030 --> 16:31.010
But deep down,

16:31.240 --> 16:34.250
I was terrified

16:34.720 --> 16:37.010
of that ruthless tyrant.

16:37.390 --> 16:38.610
Then came the great battle.

16:39.120 --> 16:41.340
Grand Mage Voidcity used his power

16:41.630 --> 16:45.220
to take the Pregenesis Sword
from the Demon Emperor.

16:45.320 --> 16:47.420
With the Human Clan's aid

16:47.440 --> 16:48.820
and my betrayal,

16:49.030 --> 16:51.340
we barely defeated him.

16:52.480 --> 16:55.460
Grand Mage Voidcity
used the Sea-Calming Pillar

16:55.790 --> 16:57.300
to seal the Demon Emperor's body

16:57.720 --> 17:01.820
beneath the Eye of the East Sea.

17:11.160 --> 17:13.900
But at that time, no one noticed

17:13.920 --> 17:17.900
the Demon Emperor left a strand of hair

17:18.480 --> 17:21.620
stuck to Voidcity.

17:21.830 --> 17:23.380
That hair carried

17:23.510 --> 17:27.940
a fragment of his soul.

17:28.240 --> 17:29.700
Years later,

17:30.000 --> 17:31.090
I learned

17:31.400 --> 17:32.730
that the strand had

17:32.830 --> 17:34.700
escaped the East Sea

17:34.920 --> 17:39.420
and hidden in the mountains
in Cattle Land,

17:39.440 --> 17:41.700
where it became a golden lotus.

17:41.830 --> 17:44.090
The Demon Emperor's soul

17:44.110 --> 17:46.700
was hidden inside it

17:47.240 --> 17:48.900
for 1,000 years.

17:49.310 --> 17:50.490
Until one day,

17:51.030 --> 17:52.700
someone picked that lotus.

17:53.160 --> 17:53.940
Who?

17:54.830 --> 17:56.730
I only found out today.

17:57.550 --> 17:59.380
The one who took it

18:00.510 --> 18:02.290
was Jin Chan.

18:02.640 --> 18:04.490
Jin Chan set a deadly trap.

18:04.720 --> 18:06.220
He opened the lotus

18:06.400 --> 18:09.290
and released the Demon Emperor's soul.

18:09.590 --> 18:13.380
It possessed Fairy Yunxiao's body.

18:13.790 --> 18:16.140
But that fragment of his soul

18:16.160 --> 18:19.810
can't wield his full power.

18:23.160 --> 18:24.490
For a thousand years,

18:25.030 --> 18:26.490
the Demon Emperor's body's

18:26.590 --> 18:28.090
thrashed and roared beneath,

18:28.110 --> 18:31.380
raging against his defeat.

18:31.720 --> 18:33.010
He wants to fight again.

18:33.030 --> 18:35.380
He wants back everything he lost.

18:36.160 --> 18:39.660
And he wants to rebuild a Demon Realm

18:40.750 --> 18:43.010
where his kind rules the world.

19:05.180 --> 19:06.820
[Forbidden]

19:06.830 --> 19:08.290
Once the Eye of the Sea is opened,

19:08.590 --> 19:11.570
his soul will burst forth

19:11.590 --> 19:14.810
and fully possess Fairy Yunxiao's body.

19:16.000 --> 19:16.900
By then,

19:17.510 --> 19:20.220
the East Sea will fall.

19:21.750 --> 19:24.620
It will be a Great Tribulation.

19:25.590 --> 19:27.420
Why didn't you stop him at that time?

19:29.400 --> 19:30.380
Stop him?

19:31.640 --> 19:33.940
Only one-thousandth of his power

19:33.960 --> 19:36.490
left us both badly hurt.

19:37.310 --> 19:38.380
Looks like

19:38.590 --> 19:40.860
you truly have no idea

19:41.000 --> 19:43.570
how terrifying the Demon Emperor is.

19:56.240 --> 19:57.290
Yi.

20:00.590 --> 20:02.900
I truly did all I could.

20:08.160 --> 20:12.490
I have guarded the East Sea

20:13.720 --> 20:14.490
for a thousand years,

20:16.400 --> 20:18.900
yet in the end, the East Sea

20:19.310 --> 20:22.220
was still lost at my hands.

20:23.720 --> 20:26.530
I was too proud.

20:27.590 --> 20:29.090
I have brought ruin to the East Sea.

20:31.510 --> 20:32.810
I have doomed Jia.

20:36.160 --> 20:39.290
And you, Yi.

20:40.640 --> 20:41.420
Your Majesty.

20:42.440 --> 20:44.900
You must not blame yourself so.

20:53.920 --> 20:54.810
Turtle.

20:57.510 --> 20:58.490
Just go.

20:58.790 --> 20:59.570
Your Majesty.

21:00.550 --> 21:03.010
Where do you want me to go?

21:03.440 --> 21:04.620
Leave the East Sea.

21:05.350 --> 21:06.700
Find your own safe path.

21:07.790 --> 21:08.900
Your Majesty.

21:09.200 --> 21:11.220
What wrong have I done?

21:11.350 --> 21:13.770
Why drive me out of the East Sea?

21:14.030 --> 21:15.330
I was wrong.

21:16.240 --> 21:18.220
The East Sea's destruction is near.

21:19.720 --> 21:21.380
I am the Dragon King of the East Sea.

21:22.400 --> 21:25.770
I must go down with it.

21:27.200 --> 21:29.220
But you are different.

21:31.160 --> 21:33.940
You smooth-talking Turtle.

21:34.480 --> 21:37.490
You'd thrive anywhere you go.

21:37.790 --> 21:39.660
Why must you stay here

21:39.680 --> 21:40.810
in the East Sea?

21:40.830 --> 21:41.620
Your Majesty.

21:42.920 --> 21:45.220
I've served you a thousand years.

21:45.590 --> 21:46.490
I'd never

21:46.510 --> 21:49.290
find a ruler as wise as you.

21:49.880 --> 21:51.010
You won't leave,

21:51.830 --> 21:53.180
I won't leave either.

22:02.310 --> 22:03.380
You should all leave too.

22:04.030 --> 22:05.290
Destruction of the East Sea

22:06.310 --> 22:07.980
is the Dragon Clan's destiny.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.330
But you are different.

22:10.920 --> 22:11.730
You can flee.

22:13.920 --> 22:14.860
Then flee.

22:16.640 --> 22:17.420
Flee?

22:22.510 --> 22:23.770
Defend the Crystal Palace.

22:24.480 --> 22:25.980
Protect the Dragon King and his son.

22:31.270 --> 22:32.900
Who are you talking to?

22:36.110 --> 22:37.420
Celestial Court soldiers.

22:37.720 --> 22:38.810
What?

22:52.310 --> 22:54.330
How many are there?

22:55.960 --> 22:56.730
One hundred thousand.

22:58.510 --> 22:59.380
One hundred thousand?

23:01.510 --> 23:03.090
From now on, Dragon Palace's security

23:03.310 --> 23:05.290
is fully handled by Celestial Court.

23:05.790 --> 23:06.570
Your Majesty.

23:08.240 --> 23:09.330
You always believed

23:09.920 --> 23:12.090
the Dragon Clan could only survive

23:12.160 --> 23:13.380
by staying neutral.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.090
But you forgot

23:15.110 --> 23:16.900
the value of having allies.

23:17.750 --> 23:20.050
Especially against an enemy
you can't defeat alone.

23:20.590 --> 23:21.810
Sometimes, friends are the only ones

23:22.440 --> 23:24.050
who can give you a chance to survive.

23:28.590 --> 23:31.700
I realized that far too late.

23:33.030 --> 23:34.660
Now Jia is gone,

23:35.000 --> 23:35.770
and Yi…

23:37.720 --> 23:38.900
Once I'm gone,

23:40.590 --> 23:42.330
there'll be no heir left

23:43.550 --> 23:45.700
to the East Sea royal family.

23:47.960 --> 23:49.090
Not necessarily.

23:55.550 --> 23:56.900
How dare you show your face?

23:58.590 --> 23:59.380
Your Highness.

24:00.790 --> 24:02.090
Wake up. Please.

24:02.110 --> 24:02.530
Stop right there.

24:02.550 --> 24:02.900
Uncle...

24:03.440 --> 24:04.330
Arrest her.

24:04.640 --> 24:05.420
Turtle Minister.

24:06.240 --> 24:07.460
Only she can save Ao Yi.

24:07.920 --> 24:09.700
She's the one who assassinated him.

24:09.830 --> 24:11.460
How can we let her near him?

24:36.510 --> 24:37.460
Uncle.

24:41.440 --> 24:42.660
Wake up.

24:44.440 --> 24:45.250
Uncle.

24:56.640 --> 24:57.420
Uncle.

24:59.920 --> 25:00.810
Uncle.

25:02.510 --> 25:03.420
Uncle.

25:04.510 --> 25:05.900
Uncle, where are you?

25:06.240 --> 25:06.980
Senior?

25:14.310 --> 25:15.420
Sorry, Senior.

25:17.720 --> 25:18.900
I shouldn't have lied to you.

25:19.110 --> 25:20.010
I'm sorry.

25:20.310 --> 25:21.700
I didn't know it was you.

25:22.000 --> 25:22.770
That day,

25:23.400 --> 25:25.380
I thought the golden dragon ate you.

25:25.720 --> 25:28.290
I thought the Dragon Clan
killed my family again.

25:28.350 --> 25:29.490
I wanted revenge.

25:29.510 --> 25:31.090
I wanted to avenge you.

25:31.400 --> 25:32.940
It was Changgeng's scheme.

25:33.200 --> 25:34.290
Don't be fooled.

25:34.680 --> 25:36.050
I thought I was getting my revenge.

25:36.310 --> 25:37.940
I never meant to hurt you.

25:37.960 --> 25:38.700
Lies.

25:38.830 --> 25:40.940
All I feel for you is hatred.

25:41.720 --> 25:42.770
Come out, quick.

25:42.790 --> 25:44.420
If you don't, you'll die.

25:44.440 --> 25:45.700
You lied to me.

25:45.720 --> 25:47.770
I will only kill you myself.

25:48.400 --> 25:49.290
Uncle.

25:50.160 --> 25:51.420
Your brother, Ao Jia,

25:51.680 --> 25:52.700
died in battle.

25:53.510 --> 25:54.290
Brother...

25:56.200 --> 25:57.770
Ain't I living just fine?

26:00.240 --> 26:00.940
Brother.

26:00.960 --> 26:02.460
This is Changgeng's scheme.

26:02.750 --> 26:03.490
Don't trust him.

26:03.510 --> 26:04.700
Jin Chan killed him.

26:04.830 --> 26:07.460
Jin Chan is Westdawn's spy
in the East Sea.

26:07.480 --> 26:08.660
Don't trust her.

26:08.680 --> 26:11.090
Don't you trust her.

26:11.110 --> 26:11.940
Uncle.

26:11.960 --> 26:14.050
You said you'd change the Dragon Clan.

26:14.310 --> 26:15.940
Right now, the East Sea Dragon Clan

26:15.960 --> 26:17.050
can only rely on you.

26:17.070 --> 26:18.250
What are you still hiding from?

26:18.640 --> 26:20.530
I believe you'll
change the Dragon Clan for the better

26:21.110 --> 26:23.050
and make sure
the tragedy never happens again.

26:23.070 --> 26:24.290
I trust only you.

26:24.480 --> 26:26.090
You are the only dragon I trust.

26:27.440 --> 26:29.090
I am Ao Yi.

26:29.160 --> 26:32.730
I am Ao Yi, destined to be a light.

26:38.790 --> 26:39.250
He's...

26:40.960 --> 26:41.900
Uncle.

26:42.070 --> 26:43.420
You're finally awake.

26:44.830 --> 26:45.620
Senior.

26:49.640 --> 26:50.620
What's wrong, Senior?

26:52.310 --> 26:53.700
He hasn't quite recovered.

26:53.920 --> 26:55.140
Why did you rush at him?

26:56.160 --> 26:57.220
Move aside, everyone.

27:00.350 --> 27:01.380
Father?

27:01.510 --> 27:02.460
Yi.

27:02.750 --> 27:03.530
My son.

27:03.550 --> 27:04.250
Father.

27:04.590 --> 27:05.900
You finally woke up.

27:05.920 --> 27:06.460
Father.

27:06.480 --> 27:07.250
Yi.

27:07.270 --> 27:09.420
My good boy.

27:09.480 --> 27:11.810
You really scared me.

27:12.480 --> 27:13.730
You finally woke up.

27:13.750 --> 27:15.290
Li Changshou.

27:21.750 --> 27:23.700
Your Highness.

27:24.110 --> 27:26.220
About that washing...

27:26.240 --> 27:27.010
Thank you.

27:28.030 --> 27:29.700
You gave me the power I now possess.

27:31.440 --> 27:32.660
You don't blame me for tricking you?

27:33.720 --> 27:34.490
I...

27:35.680 --> 27:36.530
I do blame you.

27:38.270 --> 27:39.290
But without you,

27:39.960 --> 27:41.530
I'd forever be just a little dragon.

27:47.510 --> 27:48.290
Good.

27:49.880 --> 27:50.660
Perfect timing.

27:51.110 --> 27:52.330
I have a surprise for you.

27:53.590 --> 27:54.380
What surprise?

27:55.270 --> 27:56.010
Moon Elder.

27:56.030 --> 27:56.980
Coming.

27:57.680 --> 27:59.490
Moon Elder is here.

27:59.790 --> 28:02.700
Celestial Descent.

28:12.310 --> 28:13.140
Wrong way.

28:13.750 --> 28:15.810
Celestial Descent.

28:15.830 --> 28:17.010
Holding it in so long.

28:17.110 --> 28:18.490
I can finally come out.

28:18.590 --> 28:19.380
I am...

28:21.480 --> 28:22.250
Ke Le'er?

28:22.960 --> 28:23.860
Hua?

28:24.070 --> 28:25.290
Long time no see.

28:26.110 --> 28:26.900
Hua.

28:27.550 --> 28:29.290
Weren't you...

28:30.400 --> 28:31.140
I'm back to life.

28:31.310 --> 28:32.570
How did you come back to life?

28:35.750 --> 28:36.860
Your Highness.

28:36.880 --> 28:38.290
Let me explain to you.

28:38.590 --> 28:41.180
This man right here

28:41.200 --> 28:42.620
is not truly human.

28:46.510 --> 28:48.660
I mean, not a mortal.

28:49.750 --> 28:53.490
Dashing and majestic,

28:53.510 --> 28:57.140
he is the ruler of the Celestial Court.
Haotian, the Celestial Emperor.

29:05.510 --> 29:07.490
Ao Yi greets His Majesty.

29:09.350 --> 29:11.290
Ao Guang greets His Majesty.

29:12.000 --> 29:14.010
Your Majesty, your visit

29:14.070 --> 29:16.530
honors our East Sea.

29:16.960 --> 29:18.220
I... No, no.

29:18.270 --> 29:20.330
On behalf of the East Sea,

29:20.350 --> 29:22.220
I welcome you, Your Majesty.

29:22.270 --> 29:23.050
Dragon King.

29:23.880 --> 29:24.700
Please rise.

29:25.000 --> 29:26.180
Thank you, Your Majesty.

29:26.310 --> 29:27.090
Ke Le'er.

29:27.160 --> 29:27.980
You rise too.

29:28.680 --> 29:29.770
Everyone, please rise.

29:30.240 --> 29:31.010
You can just

29:31.160 --> 29:33.010
call me Hua.

29:33.830 --> 29:35.380
Hua, let me introduce you.

29:36.030 --> 29:37.090
Minister, Si'er.

29:37.200 --> 29:38.290
Senior, come over here.

29:39.160 --> 29:40.250
Allow me to introduce you.

29:40.400 --> 29:41.010
This is Hua,

29:41.070 --> 29:42.940
whom I befriended on Bear Island.

29:44.640 --> 29:46.250
This is Jiang Si'er of the Mermaid Clan.

29:46.270 --> 29:47.050
Buddy,

29:48.550 --> 29:50.770
you arranged all of this, didn't you?

29:52.160 --> 29:53.250
Did you arrange

29:53.270 --> 29:55.010
for Celestial Emperor to appear here

29:55.310 --> 29:56.570
to meet my son?

29:57.000 --> 29:57.770
What?

29:58.480 --> 29:59.380
Not happy about it?

30:00.110 --> 30:01.700
How could I not be happy?

30:04.270 --> 30:05.250
Right now,

30:05.270 --> 30:07.180
the East Sea has Celestial Court's aid.

30:07.480 --> 30:09.380
Even if East Sea falls,

30:09.400 --> 30:12.050
our clan still has somewhere to go.

30:12.070 --> 30:14.180
I can't thank you enough.

30:16.720 --> 30:18.490
Alright, tell me.

30:19.200 --> 30:21.620
What's your escape plan next?

30:22.400 --> 30:23.730
Who said I'm escaping?

30:26.240 --> 30:26.860
You...

30:27.200 --> 30:28.700
I'll face the Demon Emperor head-on.

30:31.110 --> 30:32.460
Did you forget

30:32.640 --> 30:34.180
everything I told you?

30:35.200 --> 30:35.980
I didn't.

30:37.400 --> 30:38.570
You're right.

30:40.200 --> 30:41.180
If I mean to flee,

30:42.200 --> 30:44.460
now is indeed the best time.

30:46.030 --> 30:47.660
The old me

30:48.640 --> 30:50.730
would've bolted long ago.

30:50.750 --> 30:52.180
Then why didn't you?

30:52.550 --> 30:54.050
But it's the Demon Emperor.

30:54.350 --> 30:55.980
He just had to pick someone

30:58.000 --> 30:59.730
he shouldn't have.

31:42.350 --> 31:44.010
Petty trick.

32:24.790 --> 32:25.900
Li Changshou.

32:28.200 --> 32:29.700
Long time no see.

32:31.000 --> 32:31.900
Who are

32:33.270 --> 32:34.180
you again?

32:41.000 --> 32:42.180
You forgot me.

32:43.200 --> 32:45.770
But I've never forgotten you.

32:51.030 --> 32:52.570
My hatred for you

32:54.350 --> 32:56.900
woke me from hell.

33:04.440 --> 33:05.220
Burst.

33:12.350 --> 33:14.180
Villains die from talking too much.

33:14.200 --> 33:15.700
Keep that in mind.

33:19.110 --> 33:19.900
Li Changshou,

33:20.510 --> 33:21.940
I'm the karma of your sins,

33:21.960 --> 33:23.220
the one thing you failed to foresee,

33:23.240 --> 33:25.290
your never-ending nightmare.

33:26.590 --> 33:28.050
In this undead body,

33:28.070 --> 33:29.380
I will forever and ever...

33:31.590 --> 33:33.180
Can you let me finish?

33:38.310 --> 33:40.620
This guy does feel familiar.

33:41.550 --> 33:43.220
Who was he?

33:48.000 --> 33:48.770
I can't recall.

33:49.310 --> 33:50.180
Forget it. Not important.

33:56.240 --> 33:57.330
Ascendance Sect's move?

34:03.510 --> 34:04.290
Good.

34:04.720 --> 34:06.700
Enough talk. Let's fight.

34:16.800 --> 34:17.980
Your opponent is me.

34:18.590 --> 34:19.860
Get out of my way.

34:26.840 --> 34:27.900
Why?

34:29.000 --> 34:31.860
Why can I never beat you?

34:33.190 --> 34:35.420
I refuse to accept it.

34:36.190 --> 34:37.050
That's a wrap for you.

34:38.670 --> 34:42.570
I refuse to accept it!

34:49.000 --> 34:49.610
Yunxiao.

35:11.760 --> 35:12.570
Your Majesty.

35:12.590 --> 35:13.820
What's going on?

35:14.030 --> 35:15.260
The Great Tribulation

35:15.590 --> 35:16.780
has begun.

35:37.590 --> 35:38.780
I've waited for this moment

35:39.840 --> 35:41.010
for ages.

35:42.000 --> 35:43.170
Now, Fairy Yunxiao.

35:44.110 --> 35:45.860
Let it all begin.

36:24.230 --> 36:25.490
A thousand years.

36:26.670 --> 36:28.010
Time to wake up.

37:59.190 --> 38:00.420
Finally, we meet.

38:01.000 --> 38:02.570
Chosen One of Fate.

38:03.360 --> 38:05.610
I am Jin Chan.

38:40.660 --> 38:46.440
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

38:47.110 --> 38:53.810
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

38:55.340 --> 39:01.390
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

39:02.020 --> 39:08.470
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

39:09.210 --> 39:16.330
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

39:16.710 --> 39:23.610
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

39:23.990 --> 39:31.340
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

39:31.340 --> 39:38.510
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

39:54.650 --> 39:59.820
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

40:00.910 --> 40:07.930
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

40:09.120 --> 40:15.060
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

40:15.760 --> 40:22.840
♪Alas, our story is short♪

40:23.180 --> 40:30.290
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

40:30.610 --> 40:37.090
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

40:37.870 --> 40:45.080
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

40:45.470 --> 40:53.290
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
